00:37:33.660 --> 00:37:36.220
And that's also another
benefit of Kubernetes, right?

00:37:36.220 --> 00:37:37.710
You can have different versions.

00:37:37.710 --> 00:37:40.320
And you can actually
split traffic between all

00:37:40.320 --> 00:37:41.370
