00:37:41.370 --> 00:37:43.620
And the fact that I wasn't
applying the right security

00:37:43.620 --> 00:37:44.410
policy.

00:37:44.410 --> 00:37:46.040
So it's essentially
the fact that we

00:37:46.040 --> 00:37:48.660
