where he is a security team.

00:37:48.660 --> 00:37:51.075
And I was like, hey, my
application doesn't work.

00:37:51.075 --> 00:37:52.450
I don't know why
it doesn't work,

00:37:52.450 --> 00:37:54.480
but you've got to provide
the right security policy.

00:37:54.480 --> 00:37:56.397
IVAN BOJER: I think he
gave me actually great,

00:37:56.397 --> 00:37:58.020
