services that I've discovered

00:40:23.870 --> 00:40:27.860
in my cluster into my DAG tags.

00:40:27.860 --> 00:40:30.670
And now I can add them, as these
are the source services that

00:40:30.670 --> 00:40:32.420
are actually going to
initiate connections

00:40:32.420 --> 00:40:33.420
to destination services.

00:40:40.930 --> 00:40:43.600
And similarly, we do that
for the destination groups.

00:40:43.600 --> 00:40:45.100
These are the tags.

00:40:45.100 --> 00:40:49.240
And this now, we
actually use these tags

00:40:49.240 --> 00:40:51.200
to define a security policy.

00:40:51.200 --> 00:40:55.270
So as you can imagine, I have
a couple of different services.

00:40:55.270 --> 00:40:58.660
And I'm going to define a
security policy for the book

00:40:58.660 --> 00:40:59.770
