00:41:03.280 --> 00:41:06.760
All you need to do is once
you define a security policy,

00:41:06.760 --> 00:41:11.290
you just add tags to all the
different service pairs, if you

00:41:11.290 --> 00:41:12.640
will, that you need to define.

00:41:12.640 --> 00:41:14.110
So we're going to
actually leverage

00:41:14.110 --> 00:41:17.620
the source dynamic address
group, which is called

00:41:17.620 --> 00:41:20.163
book info source namespace.

00:41:20.163 --> 00:41:21.580
And in the destination
side, we're

00:41:21.580 --> 00:41:24.230
going to add all the
destination services.

00:41:24.230 --> 00:41:26.740
So now you see we're
defining the security policy.

00:41:26.740 --> 00:41:29.470
And on the right, you
